{"id":"ed949cc2262231c7","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-indescribable.md","title":"Indescribable Cardinal","display":"df-indescribable — Indescribable Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-indescribable","aliases":["58-df-indescribable"],"display":"df-indescribable — Indescribable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-v-alpha]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-indescribable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-indescribable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-indescribable — Indescribable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"58-df-v-alpha\">58-df-v-alpha</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span> (ordinal predicate used at reflected ranks, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^n_m\">\\(\\Pi^n_m\\)</span> (the metatheoretic class of higher-order formulas of the indicated complexity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle V_\\kappa,\\in,S\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi\">\\(\\langle V_\\kappa,\\in,S\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi\\)</span> (metatheoretic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>th-order satisfaction)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V_\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq V_\\kappa\\)</span> (parameter subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}\\)</span> (indescribability predicate defined in this file)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indescribable} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall S\\subseteq V_\\kappa\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Pi^n_m\\;\\Bigl(\\langle V_\\kappa,\\in,S\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\langle V_\\alpha,\\in,S\\cap V_\\alpha\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indescribable} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall S\\subseteq V_\\kappa\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Pi^n_m\\;\\Bigl(\\langle V_\\kappa,\\in,S\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\langle V_\\alpha,\\in,S\\cap V_\\alpha\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Indescribability is a reflection property for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^n_m\">\\(\\Pi^n_m\\)</span> sentences with predicates on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\">\\(V_\\kappa\\)</span>; it is not merely the absence of a description.</li>\n<li>Higher-order formula complexity and satisfaction are explicitly metatheoretic here; the first-order set-coded satisfaction predicate is not reused at higher type.</li>\n<li>Weakly compact cardinals are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>-indescribable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-v-alpha","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-v-alpha]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$ (ordinal predicate used at reflected ranks, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^n_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle V_\\kappa,\\in,S\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indescribable} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\forall S\\subseteq V_\\kappa\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Pi^n_m\\;\\Bigl(\\langle V_\\kappa,\\in,S\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\langle V_\\alpha,\\in,S\\cap V_\\alpha\\rangle\\models^{(n)}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^n_m","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":1708,"backlinks":[{"id":"5ce63355a126ac05","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6506f34033bb0739","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f67975eda06f32ee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^m_n}$ is the canonical indescribability predicate (see [[../batch16/58-df-indescribable.md]])."},{"id":"5ba2593b4f2ccd8a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}$ is the rank-reflection predicate from [[58-df-indescribable]]."},{"id":"d39616dd654c9cc3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]]) and $\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^1_1}$ (see [[58-df-indescribable]])"},{"id":"140ca2f0eca0be55","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi_n^m}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-indescribable]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-668","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-indescribable.md|58-df-indescribable]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","aabdf3005231e9dc","5582a281f15a33c2"]}